.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH DEMO 1
.SH NAME
demo
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdemo\fR
.SH "EXIT STATUS"
.TP
\fB0\fR
Successful program execution.
.TP
\fB1\fR
Unsuccessful program execution.
.TP
\fB101\fR
The program panicked.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
run in debug mode
\fB$ demo \-\-debug\fR
.br
debugging enabled
.TP
run as root
\fB# demo\fR

.TP
no command
\fB$\fR
